sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Op as Operator (React Web App)
    participant API as ASP.NET Core Web API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant AI as Agentic AI Subsystem

    Op->>API: POST /api/v1/disruptions (ServiceId, Reason: Engine Breakdown, Severity: Major)
    API->>DB: Insert DisruptionCase & Update Service (Disrupted)
    API->>AI: Trigger Multi-Agent Workflow (Disruption ID)
    AI->>API: Invoke Tool: CheckReplacementResources
    API->>DB: Query Unassigned Fleet & Driver Roster
    DB-->>API: Return Feasible Bus NC-4589 & Driver D-88
    API-->>AI: Return Tool Result Payload
    AI->>API: Invoke Tool: CalculatePassengerImpact
    API-->>AI: Return Affected Count = 32
    AI->>API: Invoke Tool: RequestManagerApproval (High-Impact Proposal)
    API->>DB: Persist AiWorkflow, Steps, ToolCalls & RebookingProposal
    API->>DB: Set Workflow State = PendingManagerApproval
    API-->>Op: Disruption Logged; Workflow Paused in PendingManagerApproval
